WEBVTT

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.770
they enjoy a privileged position.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.142
And it's very difficult to get
the majority of men

00:14:35.142 --> 00:14:38.188
who control the university system,

00:14:38.188 --> 00:14:40.852
the majority of men that control
the military system,

00:14:40.852 --> 00:14:44.350
the majority of men that control
the governments of the world,

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:49.584
and the majority of men that control
the great religions.

00:14:49.584 --> 00:14:52.997
So what is the basic thing
that we need to do today?

00:14:52.997 --> 00:14:55.528
I would say the best thing
that we could do today

00:14:55.528 --> 00:14:59.840
is for the women in the powerful nations

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.563
like this one, and where you come from,